sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Notebook
    participant API as training_hub API<br/>sft(), lora_grpo(), etc.
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant Algo as Algorithm Instance<br/>(SFT/OSFT/LoRA/GRPO/GEPA)
    participant Backend as Backend Implementation
    participant Framework as External Framework<br/>(verl/unsloth/ART/ilab)
    participant LLM as LLM API<br/>(via litellm)
    participant MLflow as MLflow / W&B<br/>Tracking

    Note over User,MLflow: Library Invocation Flow (in-process)

    User->>API: import training_hub<br/>training_hub.lora_grpo(data, model, ...)
    API->>Registry: Lookup algorithm + backend<br/>AlgorithmRegistry.get()
    Registry-->>API: Algorithm-Backend pair

    API->>Algo: Execute training<br/>with parameters
    Algo->>Algo: Validate required/optional params<br/>(Pydantic models)

    alt verl Backend (distributed)
        Algo->>Backend: Dispatch to verl backend
        Backend->>Backend: Convert data to Parquet<br/>for verl input schema
        Backend->>Framework: subprocess: Ray/torchrun<br/>launch distributed workers
        Framework->>Framework: FSDP sharding<br/>multi-GPU/multi-node training
        Framework->>LLM: Generate completions<br/>for GRPO reward scoring
        LLM-->>Framework: Completions
        Framework-->>Backend: Training complete
    else ART Backend (co-located engines)
        Algo->>Backend: Dispatch to ART backend
        Backend->>Framework: Initialize ART engine
        Framework->>Framework: Manage vLLM AsyncLLM<br/>engines co-located
        Framework->>LLM: LLM inference for rewards
        LLM-->>Framework: Reward scores
        Framework-->>Backend: Training complete
    else In-process Backend (ilab/unsloth/gepa)
        Algo->>Backend: Dispatch to backend
        Backend->>Framework: Direct in-process call
        Framework->>Framework: Single/multi-GPU training
        Framework-->>Backend: Training complete
    end

    opt GEPA Backend - Env Management
        Backend->>Backend: Save environment variables
        Backend->>Backend: Set OPENAI_API_KEY,<br/>OPENAI_API_BASE
        Note over Backend: Restore env after training
    end

    opt Metrics Tracking
        Backend->>MLflow: Log training metrics<br/>MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI
        Backend->>MLflow: Log to W&B<br/>WANDB_API_KEY
    end

    Backend-->>Algo: Training result
    Algo-->>API: Result
    API-->>User: Trained model / artifacts
